# With the focus on the second of two same-named Today entries, a reload caused by another program keeps it there, so x completes that one.
file <<END
Work:
	- Call Ann @due({today})
	- Call Ann @due({today})
Home:
END
keys gt j
outside <<END
Work:
	- Call Ann @due({today})
	- Call Ann @due({today})
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
status Reloaded
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Call Ann @due({today})
	- Call Ann @due({today}) @done({today})
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
